==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Ginger is a light brown cookie with a darker color between the front and back of her head, and the right side of her face being bitten off, removing her right eye. She has reddish-pink eyeshadow with two sets of eyelashes and pink, circular blush underneath her left eye. She has white, long frosting hair, the left third of it being a large curl that extends to her dress, the middle third being a shorter, rounded chunk, and her right third being a slightly smaller chunk that extends to her shoulder, along with a frosting swirl on the left of her forehead and a smaller, bitten piece on the right, with three stubs on the end of it. She also has three reddish-pink dots on the front and back of the long third of her hair and the front of her frosting swirl. She wears a reddish-pink sleeveless dress with lighter reddish-pink vertical stripes and has white, rounded lapels as well as pink and white striped stirrup tights. When hurt by a [[Twisted]], she looks forlorn.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Ginger is colored light gray, with the middle piece being a slightly darker gray. Her eye is pie-cut on the left and has dark gray eyeshadow along with lighter gray makeup. The dots on her frosted hair are colored gray. Her dress is black with gray lines, and the pink stripes on her tights are light gray.
|-|Minty Pine=
Minty Pine Ginger a is slightly redder light brown and the back of her head is colored white. She has a cat-like smile and shamrock green eyeshadow, while her makeup is pastel green with three white freckles. The dots on her hair are colored pastel green and are shaped as two triangles and a star. Her dress is shamrock green with a lighter Christmas tree design on it that has five white dots and a star on top. It also has lengthy sleeves the same lighter color. Lastly, her stirrup tights are pastel green with white polka-dots.
|-|Sugar Cookie=
Sugar Cookie Ginger is a paler color, her eyeshadow is pastel pink, and her blush is pastel blue. The long portion of her hair evenly lengthens down to her waist, and the lower half is slightly wider with four circular ends, while the center of the hair is concave. Instead of dots on her hair, there are many large, cylindrical sprinkles spread on top of it, colored in pastel shades of blue and pink. She wears a thin bow tie the same color as her hair, her dress has a scalloped hem and is pastel pink with a lighter sprinkle pattern on the lower half, and the pink stripes on her socks are pastel blue.
|-|Snow-Time=
[[Snow-Time Cosmetic Pack|Snow-Time]] Ginger's skin color is now light purple and she has purple eyeshadow with three white freckles replacing the blush. Her frosting hair is shortened to her waist and ends in five scallops, with the end scallops curved toward the sides. The hair has a light blue fade on the lower half, while the upper half has star-shaped and spherical sprinkles also colored light blue. Her dress has a much wider skirt, long sleeves, and a white pocket apron tied around the waist and her neck. It appears with a light blue to purple gradient, a decorative squiggle around it, and a white star and dot pattern rotating in a northwest direction. It also has white fluff on the collar, hem, and sleeves. The pink color on her stirrup tights is swapped out for a light blue hue. She radiates light blue dots, sparkles, and asterisk-shaped snowflakes with two additional branches on each end. When moving, a line of more detailed dendrite snowflakes can be seen accompanied by smaller dots and crosses like the ones on her dress, along with a soft light green and magenta glow representing northern lights.
|-|Golden Cookie=
Golden Cookie Ginger is slightly yellowish and wears a gold crown with six points, a red oval ornamenting each. Her eyeshadow is even redder, and her makeup is yellow with three large, white freckles. The dots on her hair are colored yellow and are also slightly larger. Her dress is yellow with two red buttons and scallops on the hem, making it slightly longer. It has two slightly darker sets of curved lines above the scallops. She wears scalloped, reddish-orange gloves, and the white on her tights is now reddish-orange, while the pink is red.
|-|New Years=
New Years Ginger is slightly oranger with darker blush and azure blue eyeshadow. Her hair is shaped braid-like, with the circular part on the back of the head followed by a smaller oval shape and another slightly smaller oval ending in three scallops. The hair has azure, cross-shaped sprinkles with dots around them, with some on the large curl on her forehead, on the front and back’s upper right sides for the first segment, left sides for the second segment, and right sides for the third segment. Behind her head, she wears a dark blue bow with lighter blends and white dots, stars, and lines arranged to look like fireworks. Her dress is knee-length and has an azure bodice along with a scalloped skirt with a similar pattern to her bow, while a slightly longer white layer can be seen beneath. Her tights are colored azure and she wears dark blue flats on her feet. She produces small, snowflake-esque sparkles and azure slivers fall from her like raindrops.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Ginger is a shy [[Toon]], as stated in her introduction card. She seems somewhat insecure (as suggested in her dialogue with {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}), and is slightly socially awkward. However, she seems to love baking as much as {{CI|Sprout|name=true}} and {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}} do, and cares for her cousin (Cosmo), despite being unable to always be there for him and the other Toons, as she is a [[Holiday Toon]]. She also tries to look for entertainment to keep herself busy outside of the holidays, proven in her interaction with {{CI|Vee|name=true}}.

Unlike her cousin, she's said to be a rather atrocious baker, but has impressive decorating skills, as stated in her introduction card.

