==Trivia==
*Ginger and {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}} are cousins, as confirmed by [[Qwelver]].<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/970049062608961560/1325989419341189130</ref>
**Ginger and Cosmo are three out of the five sets of [[Toons]] in-game to have a canonical biological relationship, the other three being {{CI|Scraps|name=true}} & {{CI|Goob|name=true}}, {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}}, {{CI|Flutter|name=true}} & {{CI|Flyte|name=true}}, and {{CI|Connie|name=true}} & {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}.
*Ginger is much more different from the other {{Type|Uncommon}} [[Event Toons]] (those being [[Flyte]] and [[Soulvester]]).
**She is the only one whose [[Mastery]] doesn't require her to play with her relative.
***This is likely because {{CI|Sprout|name=true}} needs [[Cosmo]] in his [[Mastery]] already.
****However, {{CI|Yatta|name=true}} is required for both of  {{CI|Blot|name=true}} and {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}}'s Masteries, so it may be for a different reason.
**She is the only one whose color palette and chatbox color doesn't include cyan as a predominant color.
**She is the only one who is a female.
***She is also the only one whose relative is a male.
**She is the only one who has an [[Ability]] that is fully support oriented, and can't use it for her own benefit (Flyte's speed boost can affect others but also himself, and Soulvester's Passive gives himself an extra heart and immunity to most ranged attacks).
***However, since [[Flutter]] and [[Connie]]'s Abilities are selfish, while [[Cosmo]]'s is support, it could just be a consequence of mimicking their sibling's Ability functions.
**She is the only one who technically doesn't share the same species as their relative.
***This is because Cosmo and Ginger are cousins, not siblings.
****This would also make her the only Uncommon Event Toon who doesn't have a sibling.
***However, you could count "sweet pastries" as a species rather than "brownie" and "gingerbread man" being separate.
*Ginger, {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, and {{CI|Rudie|name=true}} are the first [[Toons]] to not cost {{TI|Ichor|name=true}}.
*Ginger is one of the first Event [[Toons]] added to the game, along with {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}, [[Coal]], and [[Rudie]].
*Ginger is the fourth [[Toon]] to have eyeshadow, with the first being [[Flutter]], the second being {{CI|Teagan|name=true}}, and the third being {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}.
*Ginger is one of the few [[Toons]] whose [[Ability]] ends with an exclamation mark; some other Toons who also have an exclamation mark in their Ability's name include [[Gigi]], [[Goob]], {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}, and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}.
*Ginger binges {{CI|Vee|name=true}}'s gameshow episodes, as confirmed in their dialogue.
*Prior to [[Changelog|v0.14.1]], Ginger and [[Cosmo]]'s [[Abilities]] used to be nearly identical, with the only differences being Ginger's longer cooldown and range compared to Cosmo. However, it was changed and became more similar to [[Sprout]]'s Ability, with the differences being that Ginger heals to full [[Health]] and has a much smaller range needing to wind it up.
*Originally, when Ginger's Vintage [[Skin]] was equipped, she would have an angry expression when getting hurt instead of having her usual sad expression, this was changed in [[Changelog|v0.6.2]].
*Ginger shares the same requirements as [[Flyte]] and [[Soulvester]], with that being 700 of the respective [[Event]]'s [[currency]] and 50% [[Research]] on their respective [[Twisted]] counterparts.
**This might happen to other [[Holiday Toons]] whose Twisted counterpart is designated as {{Type|Uncommon}}.
*It is currently unknown why, when, and how Ginger's right eye got bitten off, let alone who or what did it, and no one, both in the development team and in universe questions this.
**It's not likely her eye was bitten off by a [[Toon]], considering the bite is quite large, much bigger than the size of an average Toon's mouth.
**She could possibly be bit by a [[Twisted]], but this is unlikely due to there not being [[Ichor]] on her face if so. This is, however, shown in her [[Twisted Ginger|Twisted counterpart]]'s design.
*Ginger is the fourth [[Toon]] in the game whose [[Ability]] requires {{Tape|name=true}} to use, with the first being [[Teagan]], the second being [[Sprout]], and the third being [[Blot]].
**She is the only [[Event Toon]] whose Active [[Ability]] requires [[Tapes]]. 
**She is the first [[Holiday Toon]] to do so.
**She's the only one to have her Ability changed into a Tape costing one.
**She ties with Sprout for the most expensive Ability, needing 100 Tapes.
*If you enter the "Lore Room" on the [[Seasonal Room]] as Ginger, she will say "{{Text|Oh [[Bobette]]...}}", making her the third [[Toon]], along with all the other [[Christmas Toons]], with dialogue outside of being in the [[Elevator]], using an [[Ability]] or finishing a [[Machine]], with the first being [[Vee]], and the second being {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}.
**Ginger, along with the other 2 non-{{Type|Main}} Christmas Toons, are the first Toons to have these dialogues in a "Lore Room" that is not theirs, being Bobette's instead.
***They are also the first non-Main Character Toons to have dialogues in a "Lore Room".
*Ginger is the first and currently only [[Toon]] whose Active [[Ability]] works on the [[Elevator]], granted it's not in intermission.
*Despite Ginger's [[Ability]] requiring [[Tapes]] to heal like [[Sprout]], and having the same increase of cooldown and Tape cost per Ginger like Sprout, she does not trigger the "Global Heal Cooldown" like Sprout does.
*Ginger and [[Rudie]] are the first [[Toons]] to have exclusive Golden [[Skin]] [[Quests]].
**Both of their first quests are the same: to encounter their [[Twisted]] counterparts 10 times.
*In [[Changelog|v0.14.10]], the sound Ginger makes when {{AI|Ginger|name=true}} is activated was updated to include an oven ding sound.
*Ginger is one of the three first [[Toons]] to have official voices which appeared in [[The Perfect Christmas]] song, with Ginger's voice actor being [[Qwel]], the other two Toons with voices are [[Rudie]] as AXIE and [[Bobette]] as Milk in the Microwave.
*Ginger, [[Rudie]], and [[Coal]] are the sixth [[Toons]] to appear in 2 separate thumbnails, appearing in the [[Changelog|v0.14]] and v0.14.10 thumbnails, with the first being [[Pebble]], the second being {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}, the third being {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}, the fourth being {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} and {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, and the fifth being [[Bobette]].
*Akin to how [[Sprout]], [[Cosmo]], and maybe even [[Sam]] having a kitchen for them to bake in [[Sprout's Floor]], Ginger is likely to own and cook in the kitchen found in the [[Seasonal Room]], with a pink apron seemingly for her.
*Ginger's cookies are often compared to [[Cosmo]]'s, because they seemingly don't taste as good as his. This can be seen in [[The Perfect Christmas]] and in her interactions with [[Goob]] and [[Toodles]].
*For some reason, Ginger's {{Skin|New Years}} [[Skin]] has a bald spot on the top of her head. 
**For another reason, Ginger’s {{Skin|Golden}}, {{Skin|Snow-Time}}, and {{Skin|Sugar Cookie}} have altered run animations, with her head looking down. This might to be prevent clipping, however, the hair probably can’t clip into it.
*Ginger is the first [[Toon]] to not have any interactions with {{CI|Astro|name=true}}.

